          },
          "description": "Climb a beanstalk with Jack, help out the Gingerbread Man and harvest an enormous turnip in this magic-packed Yoto Original! Featuring ten classic tales and fables retold specially for younger children, Yoto's First Fairy Tales brings stories to life with immersive sound effects and lively narration. Perfect for listening on-the-go with headphones, or at home with all the family, this Card is just right (sorry, Goldilocks!) for any occasion."
